  Scenario: A line over the available stock makes the whole reservation fail, listing each short line
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id | lines                                                                                                                                                                    |
      | res-0006        | ORD-6    | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 2 }, { sku: GADGET-2, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 401 }, { sku: GIZMO-3, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 100000 }] |
    Then the operation fails with "urn:corpus:inventory:stock:error:insufficient_stock":
      | short_lines                                                                                                                                          |
      | [{ sku: GADGET-2, location: AMS-B-0142, requested: 401, available: 400 }, { sku: GIZMO-3, location: AMS-B-0142, requested: 100000, available: 400 }] |
    And the operation emits no event

  Scenario: A SKU and location that appear on two lines are refused
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id | lines                                                                                                        |
      | res-0007        | ORD-7    | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }, { sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 2 }] |
    Then the operation fails with "urn:corpus:inventory:request:error:invalid_request"
    And the operation emits no event

  Scenario Outline: A reservation with no lines or more than 100 lines, or with a line that breaks its rules, is rejected
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id | lines   |
      | res-0008        | ORD-8    | <lines> |
    Then the input is rejected on "lines"

    Examples:
      | lines                                                              |
      | []                                                                 |
      | =repeat(101, { sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }) |
      | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 0 }]             |
      | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 100001 }]        |
      | [{ sku: AB, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }]                   |
      | [{ sku: =repeat(33, "A"), location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }]     |
      | [{ sku: -WIDGET, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }]              |
      | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-b-0142, quantity: 1 }]             |

  Scenario Outline: An idempotency key shorter than 8 or longer than 64 characters is rejected
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key   | order_id | lines                                                  |
      | <idempotency_key> | ORD-9    | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }] |
    Then the input is rejected on "idempotency_key"

    Examples:
      | idempotency_key  |
      | res-001          |
      | =repeat(65, "r") |

  Scenario: A reservation without an order id is rejected
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id | lines                                                  |
      | res-0010        | ""       | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }] |
    Then the input is rejected on "order_id"

  Scenario: A reservation of an unknown SKU is refused
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id | lines                                                     |
      | res-0011        | ORD-11   | [{ sku: NO-SUCH-SKU, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }] |
    Then the operation fails with "urn:corpus:inventory:stock:error:unknown_sku":
      | sku         |
      | NO-SUCH-SKU |

  Scenario: A reservation at an unknown location is refused
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id | lines                                                  |
      | res-0012        | ORD-12   | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: ZZZ-Z-9999, quantity: 1 }] |
    Then the operation fails with "urn:corpus:inventory:stock:error:unknown_location":
      | location   |
      | ZZZ-Z-9999 |

  Scenario: An idempotency key used before with a different body is refused
    When I run the operation with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id | lines                                                  |
      | conflict-key    | ORD-13   | [{ sku: WIDGET-1, location: AMS-B-0142, quantity: 1 }] |
    Then the operation fails with "urn:corpus:inventory:request:error:idempotency_conflict":
      | idempotency_key |
      | conflict-key    |
    And the operation emits no event
